      "body": "Independently checked `4eeca134` (AI-assisted): your unchanged regression fails on parent `fac2ce2e` (`None is True` for the sharded index), then passes on your head — one test covering all five scenarios.\n\nI used Python 3.12.3 / Torch 2.14.0+cpu with the complete tracked Python trees and original project conftest/config. Older `e68efc685` CPU build artifacts were reused, so this is metadata-path validation, not an exact-head native rebuild or a rerun of full-model generation. The earlier generation control is in [#64704](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/64704#issuecomment-6519604195).\n\nCommand: `.venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/transformers_utils/test_config.py -k test_checkpoint_has_lm_head_pytorch_bin` (same new test applied to the parent for the failing control).",
